/T (readlines\(\) on 50,000 lines\) and a much larger file would still fit. The with statement closes the file even after an error. Every rejected line is stored with its number and reason, so a bad line can never vanish silently. Decimal keeps paise exact, so totals are right to the paisa. The empty last line is skipped, and the file name is a parameter, so the function is portable and testable.)
