/T (Look Before You Leap \(LBYL\): test with if len\(parts\) == 3 and parts[2] in \('P','A'\) before using the line \(lbyl\(\)\), instead of raising and catching InvalidRecord \(eafp\(\), EAFP = easier to ask forgiveness\). Time per line is O\(1\) in both styles; the constant differs.)
/E (Look Before You Leap \(LBYL\): test with if len\(parts\) == 3 and parts[2] in \('P','A'\) before using the line \(lbyl\(\)\), instead of raising and catching InvalidRecord \(eafp\(\), EAFP = easier to ask forgiveness\). Time per line is O\(1\) in both styles; the constant differs.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
